  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.3\n\nChanged\n- A still window (Motion.Still, or the system's reduced motion) now opens and closes its pops, menus, dialogs, drawers, toasts, tooltips and sidebar at once; ticks, radio dots and switch thumbs land without easing; table rows and a TOC jump no longer slide; an alert closes at once.\n- A still window's skeletons are a plain fill without the shimmer; a spinner keeps turning.\n- A still window drops its soft shadows, keeping their inset highlights and blur-free lines, so focus rings and error glows stay.\n\nThe full list of 0.3.0 changes is on the 0.3.0 release.",
